[00:00.0000]作词 : Thomas Bergersen
[00:01.0000]作曲 : Thomas Bergersen
[01:05.7670]Through action, (身先士卒)
[01:07.8790]a Man becomes a Hero (雄姿英发)
[01:09.1940]Through death, (舍生取义)
[01:10.7740]a Hero becomes a Legend (铸就传奇)
[01:12.3270]Through time, a Legend becomes a Myth (历久弥新，终为神话)
[01:15.7080]And by learning from the Myth, (上行下效)
[01:17.5490]a Man takes action (前仆后继)
[01:19.1190]Through action, (身体力行)
[01:21.2120]a Man becomes a Hero (雄姿英发)
[01:22.2590]Through death, (马革裹尸)
[01:24.0570]a Hero becomes a Legend (铸就传奇)
[01:25.6230]Through time, a Legend becomes a Myth (历久弥新，终为神话)
[01:28.9810]And by learning from the Myth, (上行下效)
[01:31.0780]a Man takes action (薪火相传)
